<table border="0" width="93%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">              <tr><td width="100%" bgcolor="Black"><font face="Arial" size="2" color="white"><b>Wednesday, August 16, 2000<small> Posted by Shane</small></b></font></td></tr><tr><td width="100%"><font face="Arial" size="2" color="black"><BR><b><u>Show Respect to other Servers</b></u><br>Someone was on the Artic server last night claiming to be a GM from GameRealm and saying "GameRealm is out to get all the users from other servers, and put them under. We're at war!". I will tell you now this is not a view of the staff of GameRealm! I have asked the admin of the Artic server to get me the IP Address of the user who did this and if I can match it up to one of our users I will Ban that user from GameRealm!<br><br>Listen folks, PLEASE show respect to other servers when playing on other servers and posting on any Message Board! I will not tolerate this kind of trash talking!<br><br><b><u>GameRealm Main T4C Server</b></u><br>The GameRealm Main T4C Server is now a FREE Server! If you want to come join the most exciting Server on the net, what are you waiting for? We are still offering our $50 Lifetime accounts and we are now also offering Free Lifetime Accounts! So <a href="http://www.gamerealm.com/signup.asp">Sign Up</a> now!<br><br><b><u>Free Lifetime Account</b></u><br>*One Free Lifetime Account Access to our Main T4C Server<br><br><b><u>$50 Members Account</b></u><br>*One Lifetime Member Account Access to our Main T4C Server<br>*Access to any future T4C Servers we may add<br>*You get one Vote in Server Votes for settings and the direction of the game<br>*Special Raids & Events for Members only<br>*Access to Reroll (Via Quests)<br>*More to be announced</font></td></tr></table><p>
<a name="newsitem966281899,14144,"></a>
<table border="0" width="93%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">              <tr><td width="100%" bgcolor="Black"><font face="Arial" size="2" color="white"><b>Monday, August 14, 2000<small> Posted by Shane</small></b></font></td></tr><tr><td width="100%"><font face="Arial" size="2" color="black"><BR><b><u>Web Update</b></u><br>Hope everyone likes the new look, we are working on giving all of you a better site to easily find your way around and to better serve you.</font></td></tr></table><p>
<a name="newsitem965249054,64846,"></a>
<table border="0" width="93%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">              <tr><td width="100%" bgcolor="Black"><font face="Arial" size="2" color="white"><b>Wednesday, August 2, 2000<small> Posted by Shane</small></b></font></td></tr><tr><td width="100%"><font face="Arial" size="2" color="black"><BR><b><u>New EQ Community Site Launched</b></u><br>We have launched a new community site for the EverQuest Server "The Seventh Hammer" at <a href="http://www.seventhhammer.net">www.seventhhammer.net</a> which happens to be the server that quite a few of us gamerealm employees play at.</font></td></tr></table><p>
<a name="newsitem964649756,66045,"></a>
<table border="0" width="93%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">              <tr><td width="100%" bgcolor="Black"><font face="Arial" size="2" color="white"><b>Wednesday, July 26, 2000<small> Posted by Shane</small></b></font></td></tr><tr><td width="100%"><font face="Arial" size="2" color="black"><BR><b><u>NEW CHAOS EXTREME</b></u><br>Chaos Server is becoming a proving ground for who's the best of the best! When the new Isle is released there will be a defining way to end the game for a player (We don't want to give the details away, players must discover it on their own but rest assured there will be no doubt if you have reached this point) and the first player to bring this about (again we are having to be vague about the details) will be declared The Best T4C Player in the World and will hold a spot in the gamerealm Hall of Fame (soon to be built) as well as be rewarded with $100 and we will allow the player to move their account to our Main T4C Server (we will allow the Top 10 players to move their characters over to our Main T4C Server).<br><br>Once we find out who is the Best T4C Player in the World, Chaos Server will be wiped (We are guessing it will be another 7 months to a year before this will happen) and we will start all over again!<br><br>So let Chaos Rule and only the Best will Survive!</font></td></tr></table><p>
<a name="newsitem963940803,41689,"></a>
<table border="0" width="93%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">              <tr><td width="100%" bgcolor="Black"><font face="Arial" size="2" color="white"><b>Tuesday, July 18, 2000<small> Posted by Shane</small></b></font></td></tr><tr><td width="100%"><font face="Arial" size="2" color="black"><BR><b><u>Diablo II Trainers & Cheats out already</b></u><br>New <a href="http://damsgp2.com/d2">trainers</a> already! My biggest problem with Diablo & Diablo II are the trainers! Already Diablo II has lost most of its creditability much like Diablo did, why play fair when you can cheat? This seems to be the general attitude of today's game players I have met who play the Diablo games. So while your out there running around trying to get that next cool item, there are a bunch of players duping, changing their stats and giving themselves experience only to make killing you a bit easier. For those of you who are saying WAIT this only works on the Open server, sorry to be the one to tell you there are trainers and cheats for closed out there even as I write this.</font></td></tr></table><p>

